msgstr "JSON：装配清单、窗口内基因、序列、bigWig 数值、搜索"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:62
msgid "``/export/...``"
msgstr "``/export/...``"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:63
msgid "Rendered exports"
msgstr "渲染好的导出文件"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:65
msgid ""
"The window itself is QtWebEngine, so the frontend is ordinary browser code —"
" Canvas for tracks, plain DOM for controls, no framework. The same page runs"
" in Chrome if you pass ``--browser``, which is how most of the UI is tested."
msgstr ""
"窗口本身是 QtWebEngine，所以前端就是普通浏览器代码——轨道用 Canvas，控件用原生 DOM，没有框架。加 ``--browser`` "
"时同一个页面也能在 Chrome 里跑，UI 的大部分测试就是这么做的。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:70
msgid "Why this shape"
msgstr "为什么这样设计"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:76
msgid "Decision"
msgstr "决策"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:77
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "理由"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:78
msgid "No framework"
msgstr "不用框架"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:79
msgid ""
"The whole frontend is one file and loads instantly; there is no build step"
msgstr "整个前端就是一个文件，加载即用，没有构建步骤"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:80
msgid "Standard library only"
msgstr "只用标准库"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:81
msgid ""
"No wheels to compile, no version conflicts, and the frozen build is small"
msgstr "没有要编译的 wheel，没有版本冲突，冻结产物也小"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:82
msgid "Compile annotations ahead of time"
msgstr "注释提前编译"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:83
msgid "Startup cost moves to the build machine, where it is paid once"
msgstr "启动开销转移到构建机上，只需付一次"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:84
msgid "Stream sequence"
msgstr "序列走流式"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:85
msgid "A 3 GB genome is not something you want in an installer"
msgstr "3 GB 的基因组不该塞进安装包"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:86
msgid "Qt over a web view"
msgstr "用 Qt 而不是纯网页"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:87
msgid ""
"Same rendering engine as Chrome, but a real window and real file dialogs"
msgstr "与 Chrome 同一个渲染引擎，但有真正的窗口和原生文件对话框"
